Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.28,0:09:52.44,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}Nobody knows who I am
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.21,0:09:56.15,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}Not even certained myself
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.19,0:10:00.38,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}Created and then erased
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.13,0:10:11.13,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}Who sent me Lost in my emotions
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.13,0:10:14.30,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}What makes me blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:19.49,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.75,0:10:22.71,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}I need to face myself for now
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.71,0:10:24.72,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}I've been avoiding for so long
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:26.77,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(85,85)}Nevertheless, my heart protests
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.77,0:10:28.72,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}Something backs me to his throne
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.72,0:10:30.72,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}But when the real and the fake unite
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.72,0:10:32.70,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}Keep your eye to your soul as you tired
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.70,0:10:34.69,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}I see them alright, that's my usual line
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.69,0:10:36.48,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}But I'm not okay anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.48,0:10:38.64,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(85,125)}Cause we almost like we're in the dead board
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.64,0:10:40.51,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(85,125)}I would like you to answer Am I alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.51,0:10:43.65,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}Tic-tac-toe to heaven or hell
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.65,0:10:44.70,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(85,125)}Give me a break
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.79,0:10:46.45,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(85,125)}Carry on stuck in my head
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.45,0:10:48.77,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}I am not a puppet
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.03,0:10:56.24,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}But you'll always care about me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.52,0:11:01.87,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}You'd never ask me for, nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.11,0:11:09.89,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}May I see the future smiling from our hope
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.11,0:11:12.43,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}Let me please
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:17.92,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}Please let me charge you with power
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.17,0:11:20.37,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}Oh mystery
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.61,0:11:26.63,INS-EN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}Can know me much more from now on
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.28,0:09:52.44,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(125,125)}無人知曉我是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.21,0:09:56.15,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}連我自己都不確定
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.19,0:10:00.38,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}被創造 又被抹去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.13,0:10:11.13,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}是誰讓我在情感中迷惘
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.13,0:10:14.30,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}是什麼讓我憂傷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:19.49,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}我該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.75,0:10:22.71,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}此刻我需要面對自己
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.71,0:10:24.72,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}我已經逃避了許久
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:26.77,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(85,85)}然而 我的心在抗拒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.77,0:10:28.72,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}有什麼將我引回他的王座
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.72,0:10:30.72,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}但當真真假假交織重疊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.72,0:10:32.70,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}疲倦時 請注視你的靈魂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.70,0:10:34.69,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}我看得清晰 回答如常
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.69,0:10:36.48,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}但我已無心力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.48,0:10:38.64,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(85,125)}因為我們已經幾近死局
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.64,0:10:40.51,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(85,125)}我希望你能告訴我 我是否孑然一身
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.51,0:10:43.65,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}井字棋通往的是天堂還是地獄
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.65,0:10:44.70,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(85,125)}讓我稍微休息
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.79,0:10:46.45,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(85,125)}持續遭困在我腦海中
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.45,0:10:48.77,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}我不是任人擺布的人偶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.03,0:10:56.24,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}但你一直關心著我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.52,0:11:01.87,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}你從未向我索取過
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.11,0:11:09.89,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}願我得見我們的希望中綻放未來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.11,0:11:12.43,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}請讓我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:17.92,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}請讓我賦予你力量
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.17,0:11:20.37,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}神秘啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.61,0:11:26.63,INS-CN-RED,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(125,125)}從今往後 能否更懂我一些
