Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.78,0:23:51.57,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}不要認同它
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.57,0:23:53.37,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}是絕命 亦是名為禮物的威脅
