Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.58,0:24:00.79,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}我永遠支持你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.79,0:24:02.50,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}但是現在你必須扣下扳機
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.50,0:24:03.13,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2}翻江倒海的緋紅色
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.13,0:24:04.71,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}來吧! 展示你的想法!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.71,0:24:07.30,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}若不相連 善惡顛倒黑白
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.30,0:24:09.34,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}吐露懺悔也不過是擲骰子的結果
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.34,0:24:18.85,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}你也只想泯然眾人?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.22,0:24:18.85,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.52,0:24:21.06,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}帶上自己的盾牌
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.06,0:24:23.48,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}衝破牢籠 成就自己的叛逆
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.48,0:24:25.61,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}因為你百般厭倦虛假的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.61,0:24:29.11,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}感受憂鬱 亂寫劇本的飢渴形成反饋
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.11,0:24:30.53,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}撲倒 並且舉盾
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.53,0:24:31.86,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}但是你必須反擊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.86,0:24:32.99,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}這不是在聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.99,0:24:35.16,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}因為你百般厭倦虛假的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.16,0:24:38.49,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}傷痕與瘀青 於超脫的次元刻印契約
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.49,0:24:39.70,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}高舉拳頭 烙印其中
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.70,0:24:42.04,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}不要因為感到害怕而裝作他人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.04,0:24:44.46,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}進攻厄敵 斬落對方騎士
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.46,0:24:46.84,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}今天並非你的忌日
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.84,0:24:49.13,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}飄蕩的幻影 傳達指令
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.13,0:24:50.34,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}不要假裝自己困於其中
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.34,0:24:51.51,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}你隨時可以發聲
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.51,0:24:53.72,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}不存在放棄抵抗認輸的技術
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.72,0:24:56.05,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}因此你要向天空詠唱你的咒語
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.05,0:24:58.39,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}審判其主 追尋毀滅的原罪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.39,0:25:00.56,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}不要因為感到害怕而裝作他人
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.56,0:25:03.06,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}進攻厄敵 斬落對方騎士
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.06,0:25:05.60,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,200)}今天並非你的忌日
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.60,0:25:07.44,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\an3\blur2\fad(200,0)}飄蕩的幻影 傳達指令
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.90,0:23:50.78,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}幻惑の対価
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.78,0:23:51.57,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}Chya don't get it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.57,0:23:53.37,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}絶命かGIFTかの脅威
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.37,0:23:55.62,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}甘んじて受けるか that they tag you with
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.62,0:23:57.87,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}So go face what's coming and don't ask why
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.87,0:23:59.58,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}度外視のfakeが牽強付会
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.58,0:24:00.79,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}I'm always getting your back
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.79,0:24:02.50,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}But now you got to grip the trigger
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.50,0:24:03.13,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2}翻す深紅
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.13,0:24:04.71,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}Come on! Show me how you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.71,0:24:07.30,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}繫げ さもなくば低コントラストの善悪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.30,0:24:09.34,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}懺悔を吐けば 骰子次第
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.34,0:24:18.85,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}Just like all the rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.22,0:24:18.85,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}Get out
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.52,0:24:21.06,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}Go take some cover
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.06,0:24:23.48,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}Butchya gotta break out to be the brat
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.48,0:24:25.61,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}Cuz ya tired of being just a copycat
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.61,0:24:29.11,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}Feel the blues チラっく筋書き乱す飢渇をfeedback
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.11,0:24:30.53,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}Duck and cover
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.53,0:24:31.86,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}But chya gotta bite back
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.86,0:24:32.99,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}This ain't chitchat
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.99,0:24:35.16,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}Cuz ya tired of being just a copycat
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.16,0:24:38.49,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}Cuts and bruises 超俗した次元の契約を刻む
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.49,0:24:39.70,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}Fist emblazoned
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.70,0:24:42.04,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}Don't pretend to be someone you're not cuz you feel
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.04,0:24:44.46,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}攻め込んだin check なぎ倒したKnight
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.46,0:24:46.84,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}Today's not the day for you to die
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.84,0:24:49.13,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}The drifting phantoms 下す采配
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.13,0:24:50.34,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}Don't pretend to be trapped
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.34,0:24:51.51,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}You can always appeal
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.51,0:24:53.72,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}無抵抗に匙を投げるtechはない
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.72,0:24:56.05,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}So cast all your spells up in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.05,0:24:58.39,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}Judge his master 破滅問う原罪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.39,0:25:00.56,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\fad(200,200)}Don't pretend to be someone you're not cuz you feel
